      {
        "databaseId": 146,
        "title": "christianitytoday.com",
        "slug": "christianitytoday-com",
        "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Role:</strong> Frontend Developer (Contractor)</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Tech Stack:</strong> WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg), React, Svelte, Advanced Custom Fields (ACF Pro), WordPress REST API, Modern CSS / SCSS</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Engineered a custom, production-ready block suite for Christianity Today’s digital publishing platform, translating complex, high-fidelity design specifications into flexible, reusable editorial components within the WordPress block editor.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Challenge</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The publication required a modern editorial toolkit to create rich, visually sophisticated long-form stories and landing pages. The core objective was achieving pixel-perfect fidelity with strict Figma design systems while keeping the editing experience intuitive, performant, and resilient against layout breakage across different viewports.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Solution</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Operating as an external frontend contractor, I developed custom blocks leveraging React, Svelte, and ACF Pro integrated with the WordPress Block API. I established modular styling architectures and strict component props to enforce design tokens (typography, spacing, responsive grid behaviors) directly in the editor canvas, providing content creators with a true WYSIWYG experience that mirrored frontend output with zero layout drift.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Highlights</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Pixel-Perfect Execution:</strong> Translated intricate editorial design systems into responsive, fluid components matching design specifications down to exact spacing and typography scales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Hybrid Modern Architecture:</strong> Combined the power of React and lightweight Svelte components with the WordPress Block API to ensure optimal editor performance and clean, decoupled frontend markup.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Streamlined Content Authoring:</strong> Empowered editorial teams to assemble dynamic layouts independently while programmatically safeguarding brand consistency and layout integrity.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Seamless Theme Integration:</strong> Built modular, decoupled components engineered to integrate cleanly into the client’s existing WordPress theme architecture and deployment pipeline.</li>\n</ul>\n",
