      {
        "databaseId": 42,
        "title": "norceca.info",
        "slug": "norceca-info",
        "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Role:</strong> Lead Developer</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Tech Stack:</strong> WordPress, PHP (OOP), Advanced Custom Fields (ACF Pro), JavaScript (Fetch / REST API), CSS3 / Sass</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A dynamic platform built for real-time sports tournament management and tracking, engineered to centralize live score publishing and participant documentation distribution.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Challenge</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The client required an agile system capable of reflecting instant match scores and tournament standings during live events. The core priority was eliminating operational dependencies on technical staff for real-time score updates, bracket modifications, and documentation management.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Solution</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As the Lead Developer, I architected a modular content structure using custom post types and custom fields, transforming the WordPress admin dashboard into an intuitive, error-proof editorial environment. For live scores and standings, I implemented a lightweight, decoupled data-fetching workflow via custom REST API endpoints, enabling instant client-side updates without triggering full page reloads or overloading server resources during high-traffic matches.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Highlights</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Real-Time Score &amp; Standings Tracking:</strong> Instant updates to scoreboards and tournament tables with zero page refreshes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Autonomous Editorial Workflow:</strong> Structured input validation that prevents human error and removes developer overhead during live matches.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Centralized Document Hub:</strong> Secure, organized repository for tournament rules, registration forms, and guidelines.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>High-Concurrency Performance:</strong> Optimized queries and data payload caching built to withstand traffic surges on competition days.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
        "modified": "2026-10-25T05:35:13",
        "status": "publish",
        "isRestricted": false,
        "hasPassword": false,
        "language": {
          "code": "EN"
        },
